VALUES
    ('Bah, Humbug Refund Policy', 'Runs the returns desk like it''s three ghosts short of a personality change. Every refund request gets a "we''ll see" and a long, judgmental pause.', 'profile_frame', 'scrooge-refunds', 115000),
    ('Great on Camera, Menace Off It', 'Charming, articulate, and warm for the first ten minutes of the call. Then the client mutes themselves and things get weird.', 'profile_frame', 'jekyll-hyde-video-call', 120000),
    ('What Big Eyes You Have, Subscribe', 'Wanders into the woods for content and somehow always finds the one wolf willing to do a collab. Basket full of ring lights, not pastries.', 'profile_frame', 'red-riding-hood-influencer', 125000),
    ('Blows Down Deals, Not Houses', 'Huffs, puffs, and somehow still can''t close on the brick one. Great at open houses, terrible at load-bearing walls.', 'profile_frame', 'big-bad-wolf-realtor', 130000),
    ('Ringing All Day, Answering None', 'Lives above the office, hears every notification, responds to zero of them. The bells are doing just fine; the group chat is not.', 'profile_frame', 'quasimodo-notifications', 135000),
    ('Chasing One White Whale (His Engagement Rate)', 'Obsessed with a single viral post from three years ago and hasn''t recovered since. The crew just wants him to post something normal for once.', 'profile_frame', 'ahab-viral', 140000),
    ('Substitute Teacher, Full Mutiny', 'Wooden leg, a parrot heckling from the back row, and a seating chart he refuses to follow. Somehow still the students'' favorite sub.', 'profile_frame', 'long-john-silver-substitute', 145000),
    ('Selling Boots, Slaying Looks', 'Talks his way into every room and somehow leaves with a sale, a compliment, and everyone''s undivided attention. The boots sell themselves; the confidence doesn''t need to.', 'profile_frame', 'puss-in-boots-fashion', 150000);
